<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Australis will defend court action.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Australis will defend court action.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australis Media Ltd said on Monday that it would vigorously defends claims made against the pay television operator in the New South Wales Supreme Court by the owners of the rival Foxtel network.</p>
<p>Australis said it and another pay television group, Optus Vision Pty Ltd, were defendants to one claim by News Corp Ltd and Foxtel, and another by Telstra Corp Ltd.</p>
<p>The claims sought to prevent an infrastructure sharing agreement approved last month between Australis and Optus Vision, it said. The claims were without merit, Australis said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
